exports[`pii.scan.via.brain.sh given: [case17] a review that SKIPS when: [t0] the reviewer reports zero counts with no logs then: the stdout matches its snapshot 1`] = `
"
🦅 the review could not run

🔎 pii.review
   ├─ scope: diffs since-staged
   ├─ reviewers: 1
   │
   │  ├─ 💥 fake/one — verdict unreadable
   │
   ├─ this is a malfunction, not a PII hit — the diff
   │  was never actually examined by those reviewers
   │
   │  ── fake/one: no readable verdict, on 2 attempt(s) ──
   │  cause: no logs: line — the review skipped, or crashed before it wrote logs
   │  🔍 review
   │     └─ review: <tmp>
   │
   ├─ no logs or no verdict json: most often the review brain has
   │  no key. rhx review boots its brain under keyrack env prep,
   │  so unlock prep and retry:
   │     rhx keyrack unlock --owner ehmpath --env prep
   │  if the brain key is absent there, a human fills it:
   │     rhx keyrack set --owner ehmpath --key FAKE_API_KEY --env prep
   └─ a check that could not run must never look like one that
      passed, so this blocks
"
`;

